Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:03.26,Main,Club Members,0,0,0,,Nine hundred and ninety-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:06.37,Main,Club Members,0,0,0,,Nine hundred and ninety-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.99,Main,Club Members,0,0,0,,One thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.29,0:00:10.69,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Let's break...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.69,0:00:13.64,Main,Club Members,0,0,0,,...the limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:16.68,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Ray, want to go buy some \Nprotein after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.13,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I must refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,After school, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.17,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.66,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:27.44,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,The spare key to our club's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:30.17,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,None of the other club \Nmembers can make it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:33.46,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,I think you'll be there \Neven before Miss Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.46,0:00:34.83,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:37.51,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking the trouble \Nto tell me, Miss Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.79,Main,Sara,0,0,0,,I-It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.64,Main,Sara,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks for doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:56.03,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,U-S-A!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.61,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:09.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.79,0:01:16.32,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I guess she likes bunnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.95,0:01:45.71,Sign_Basic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3}T{\3c&HB3571A&}h{\3c&HB35621&}e{\3c&HB45529&} {\3c&HB45430&}I{\3c&HB55337&}c{\3c&HB5513E&}e{\3c&HB65045&}b{\3c&HB64F4C&}l{\3c&HB74E54&}a{\3c&HB74D5B&}d{\3c&HB84C62&}e {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}S{\c&HB54F25&}o{\c&HB8482F&}r{\c&HBA403A&}c{\c&HBD3944&}e{\c&HBF314F&}r{\c&HC22A59&}e{\c&HC42264&}r\N{\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}Shall {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}R{\c&HB94533&}u{\c&HBE344B&}l{\c&HC42264&}e {\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}the {\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3\c&HFFFFFF&}W{\3c&HB65428&}o{\3c&HB94F3C&}r{\3c&HBD4B51&}l{\3c&HC04665&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:48.02,ep title,Titl,0,0,0,,{\fad(550,0)}Episode 4\N{\fscx80}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Releases His Secret Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:50.47,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.47,0:02:54.17,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,This is tea made from some plants \Ngrown by the gardening club.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:56.35,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Miss Rebecca,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.43,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,even though it was an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.43,0:03:02.20,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am terribly sorry for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.29,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Y-You really don't have to say all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:10.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I just happened to be changing in there \Nbecause my gym class ended early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.43,0:03:11.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Usually...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:18.14,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,U-Usually... I wear much \Nmore grown-up underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:19.34,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.78,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:21.89,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:24.14,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,So please forget about what you saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.59,0:03:25.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:30.00,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.18,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So, what is this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:35.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It seems to be more worn than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.29,0:03:38.32,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh, that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:42.91,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Those are the collective records \Nof the gardening club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:47.62,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,There is even information in there that \Nregular illustrated guides don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.78,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Have you written in it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:52.09,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:57.58,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I have specifically added notes about \Nflowers that were modified by sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:03:59.35,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,By sorcery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.35,0:04:00.33,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:07.86,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,For example, this plant here \Nis able to use sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:09.04,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.62,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Plants have the capacity to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:12.45,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,They do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:14.81,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,This is particularly common \Nin carnivorous plants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.01,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Through the process of evolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:19.10,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,they've begun displaying phenomena \Nsimilar to sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:22.08,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The mysteries of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.39,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:27.45,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Speaking of, your marigolds \Nalso have their own entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.12,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'd love to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:32.37,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:33.93,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:38.62,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I'm just happy that I can teach \Na new member things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:44.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But there are other members \Nin the club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:47.15,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.44,0:04:50.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I suppose since I'm from one \Nof the three great houses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.88,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,people can't help but keep me at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.55,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,They're all lovely people,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:58.97,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,but when I try to show them something \Nlike this, they politely decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:03.31,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I suppose I also find it \Ndifficult to open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:08.20,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's why I am happy that\Nyou're so easy to talk to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.58,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,If you don't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:14.98,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,then I'd love to continue receiving \Nlessons like this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:18.18,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Well, I can be a strict teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.58,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:24.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,May I borrow this \Nbook to do some studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:25.34,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:29.38,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:32.95,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You'll be on the organizational staff \Nfor the Magic Chevalier, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:33.79,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.79,0:05:36.56,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I thought I'd go cheer on Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.76,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Amelia is the big favorite \Nfor the rookie bracket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:44.56,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,The daughter of House Rose, \Nthe leader of the three great houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:45.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Speaking of,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:50.62,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,is there nobody from the third \Nfamily at this academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:52.17,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:55.83,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,The Algrens have traditionally attended \Nthe Diom Academy of Sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:56.95,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:06:00.21,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That house also has an eldest daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:05.35,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,So I think she'll be a \Ngood rival for Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:13.82,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,The Magic Chevalier is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:16.04,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,The academies will soon begin \Ntheir preliminary rounds
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.31,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,and select their representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:19.23,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,In the rookie bracket,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:22.31,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,you will be facing off \Nagainst fellow first-years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:26.70,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,meaning that anybody who's \Nplanning to enter is your rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:32.27,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,The winner is Amelia Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:35.53,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.32,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.25,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,May I please fight Ray next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:42.07,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.55,0:06:44.78,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,Miss Amelia wants to fight that nobody?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:47.06,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,How dare that withered scum?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:49.13,Main,Jeryl,0,0,0,,She will crush him, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.06,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,But White is not going to \Nbe one of the partici—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:53.33,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray White...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.90,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Will you be my opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:59.41,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Professor Arkwright, I have no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.16,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,And begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:10.67,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,Not too heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:12.19,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,but fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.07,0:07:18.67,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're quite the mystery, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:21.96,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're not very skilled when it comes \Nto sorcery, yet you excel at the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:24.58,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Your skill in actual battle in the \NKafka Forest was amazing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:28.16,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to \Nfight you at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.28,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.08,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Those words make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's improve together, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:35.82,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:42.24,Main,Girls,0,0,0,,So strong! So beautiful! So exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:46.65,Italics,Amelia,0,0,0,,I will land a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:51.16,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,Oh, this feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:24.02,Main,Elliot,0,0,0,,A-And the winner is... Amelia Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.98,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You really are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.28,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray, that last... that last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:40.95,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:43.03,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:47.77,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Who... Who are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.92,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,That damn ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:59.29,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I would've loved to see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.31,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,It was a close fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:02.87,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.87,0:09:05.56,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,You both looked so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:09.36,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,But you're really something with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.92,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Where did you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I have a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:17.03,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,A master?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:18.16,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Who teaches you sword fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:24.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Sword fighting, sorcery, \Nwhat kind of person to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,so all sorts of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.44,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,She's my mentor in everything, basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:32.12,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It was pretty brutal, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:33.84,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,She was that strict?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:35.97,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.70,0:09:40.07,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So much so that life here feels like heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.07,0:09:40.86,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:45.03,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,maybe that ordinary is \Nactually really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:47.36,Main,Jeryl,0,0,0,,He was first in the Kafka Forest, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:50.96,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,I figured they'd naturally win since \NMiss Amelia was on their team,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:53.35,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,but maybe it was actually because of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.70,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:01.08,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I hereby challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.36,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,You better not run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.48,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Don't pee yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.48,0:10:05.79,Main,Cusuechs & Zuina,0,0,0,,Or soil yourself another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:07.87,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:08.75,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:17.37,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,You think he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.16,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I can help him, if it comes to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:24.98,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,There's a barrier around this entire area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.53,0:10:28.52,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Is it so nobody hears the sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:32.43,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mr. Alium, what are the rules for the duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.43,0:10:33.88,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:38.02,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Needless to say, the use of \Nsorcery is permitted, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.41,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:41.61,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:42.71,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:44.12,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,You're using a real sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:46.98,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Whoever admits defeat is the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:48.61,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Beyond that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.89,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,we need no rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:57.91,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Ray White...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:01.56,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I'll kill you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.52,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.87,0:11:14.97,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Come here and fight, ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.31,0:11:17.91,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,Is this just him getting worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:18.98,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,Or is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.78,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,There is no way I will lose to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:24.33,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,If I can compile sorcery...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.70,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,there is no way I can lose \Nto a muscle brain like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.70,0:11:28.53,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:31.78,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I... I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:36.40,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I was born to be the heir to House Alium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:39.35,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,House Alium is a noble line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:43.93,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,Even so, we're in the lower \Nechelons of the middle tier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:45.83,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,A far cry from being notable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:50.99,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,Over this, I had seen my father \Nhumiliated countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.99,0:11:54.23,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,So I decided what the purpose \Nof my life shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:58.60,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I will raise up the name of \NHouse Alium and ensure that we thrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:00.43,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,I will relentlessly work at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:03.25,Italics,Albert,0,0,0,,and eventually become a grand sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:04.47,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.67,Italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Kill Ray White!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:14.97,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Is dodging all you can do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:16.99,Italics,Ray,0,0,0,,If it's just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:26.27,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.97,0:12:29.29,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,He cut the spell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:33.61,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mr. Alium, let me teach \Nyou how big our world is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:36.65,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:37.44,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:37.79,Main - Top,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:38.02,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.20,0:12:44.05,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn it, damn it, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.05,0:12:45.93,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:46.99,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:48.74,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Why won't any of them hit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.66,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Y-You!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.69,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,You must actually be a noble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:57.97,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,You're some hidden bastard of \None of the three great houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:12:58.99,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:01.90,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I was definitely born an ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:05.80,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,And yet, despite my birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:08.04,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I can use sorcery and \NI can also fight like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:14.31,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mr. Alium, I understand that \Nheritage is very important to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:18.81,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean\Nyou're a great sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:20.06,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:22.86,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Then eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:23.98,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Hey, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.73,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Isn't that an Extensive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:30.25,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Febris Draco!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:32.44,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.31,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:58.76,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What on earth am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.51,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Ray, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.79,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You have to tell us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.34,0:14:18.96,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:21.79,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:37.90,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:42.21,Main,Male Voice,0,0,0,,Spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:44.03,Main,Male Voice,0,0,0,,It really was spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:45.45,Main,Male Voice,0,0,0,,That is youth for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:49.24,Main,Male Voice,0,0,0,,But you will now all become \Nliving sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:52.28,Main,Male Voice & Gray,0,0,0,,But do not despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:55.40,Main,Male Voice & Gray,0,0,0,,You will be contributing to the \Ndevelopment of a magnificent sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:14:58.42,Main,Male Voice & Gray,0,0,0,,Is that not something to be proud of?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.03,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.20,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.91,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Ray White?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:05.79,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Professor Gray?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:11.68,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Such an exciting situation! \NIt really makes the heart sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:13.55,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,R-Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:16.69,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'll explain myself when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,No more secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.47,0:15:21.37,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But please wait for just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:26.95,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It looks like I have no choice \Nbut to fight Professor Gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:31.30,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You are obviously no average person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.36,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.00,0:15:36.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,And now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.82,0:15:37.96,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:41.94,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Share your thoughts, White.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:46.44,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You belong to Eugenics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:51.06,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Your aim is to get the students' engrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:52.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The brains of sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:56.72,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sure those expelled students you \Nalluded to are also a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:01.12,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You are correct, Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:03.81,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I don't dislike sharp people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.81,0:16:06.97,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,And now I've become \Ninterested in your engram.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:13.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You were trying to abduct students in \Nthe Kafka Forest during that exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:16.48,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That monster that had no \Nbusiness being there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You were controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.57,0:16:19.15,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Correct again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.39,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Truly impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:23.25,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That exercise is a yearly godsend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:27.55,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,It's so easy to excuse that another \Nstudent disappeared from the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.53,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,And then, oh, how I mourn them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:34.21,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The tragedy's heroine: \N"No, why did it have to be my students?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:36.01,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:39.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're the one who \Nincited Mr. Alium, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.64,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:46.15,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Only his pride is big enough to measure. \NThe rest of him is pathetic trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.37,0:16:52.81,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,But in the end, he was a convenient stall \Nfor time while I erected this powerful barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:04.13,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I got a promising crop of \Nstudents in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:06.15,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,With this many brains,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:09.12,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,my standing in Eugenics will rise, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.06,0:17:13.71,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So everything you told \Nme was a complete lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:15.39,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:18.32,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You had caught my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:24.15,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I always talk to students privately \Nwhen I'm interested in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:28.89,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,As the considerate and \Ncompassionate teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.89,0:17:29.71,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So, how did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.39,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I played the part well, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.83,0:17:37.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Please be prepared to lose an \Narm or two, Professor Gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:40.90,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What? You're still calling me "Professor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.56,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,All right, Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:45.95,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You truly are interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:51.02,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I'll keep you alive while I study \Nthat engram in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.24,0:17:53.55,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:58.40,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You're a sorcerer who has specialized \Nin close-quarters combat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:17:59.70,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,And despite being an ordinary,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:03.02,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,you seem to have an abnormally \Nhigh capacity for prima materia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:06.66,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,But as long as you can't get near me, \Nthere is nothing you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.66,0:18:08.64,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Fire Snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:16.32,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Now what are you going to do, Ray White?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.14,0:18:19.50,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Watching you just run away isn't amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.32,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So then, what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:30.05,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I'll take you all down at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.30,Italics,Lydia,0,0,0,,However, once the time comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:35.04,Italics,Lydia,0,0,0,,you have to make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.26,Italics,Lydia,0,0,0,,After all, I did pass the mantle of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.11,0:18:39.96,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Chronos Lock, release!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:46.99,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.99,0:18:48.06,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:54.15,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:57.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But I must do this to protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.73,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Icicle Blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:10.53,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Blades... of ice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:11.72,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.28,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,An I-Iceblade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:20.94,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,They said the Iceblade Sorcerer \Ndisappeared in the Far East War!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:22.77,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:26.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But the Iceblade Sorcerer \Ntitle had been passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.15,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,To a certain boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:33.70,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This can't be, this can't be, \Nthis can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.70,0:19:35.10,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:38.86,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Stop spewing... lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:50.22,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So what if you have iceblades?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.22,0:19:53.49,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Even if you are one of the seven grand \Nsorcerors, you can't block this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:56.57,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Causality Draco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:02.10,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Antimaterial Code, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.72,0:20:08.28,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,It disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.20,0:20:10.55,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:11.95,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Professor Gray,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:15.55,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,why don't I show you the true \Nnature of the Iceblade Sorcerer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:18.35,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:20.36,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:23.31,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Stay back! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:31.54,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Frame Lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:36.24,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.38,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Are you really...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.88,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Are you really {\i1}that{\i0} Iceblade?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.02,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:52.40,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,S-Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:54.44,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:56.70,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Okay, don't say another word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.45,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Please just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:03.44,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Why don't I, I mean, may I \Nintroduce you to Eugenics?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.39,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:08.19,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'd make you one of their leaders!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:12.09,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So please, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:17.09,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,My research to unveil \Nthe truth cannot end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.53,0:21:19.58,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:27.47,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.26,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:32.73,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.73,0:21:33.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:36.91,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You monster...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.70,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Is that all, Professor Gray?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.84,0:21:47.42,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:51.27,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Even as a platinum, I can't \Ncompete with grands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:54.68,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,But then the strongest of \Nthe seven grand sorcerers?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.89,0:21:57.52,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I just can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:04.13,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So what will you do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:06.79,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You going to kill me with that iceblade?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:07.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:10.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Your punishment will fit the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.35,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You're going to capture me alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:14.92,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:17.32,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,So that's how it's going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:21.40,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm gonna have to go all out, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.14,0:22:26.16,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Dark Triad System!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:29.56,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.93,0:22:46.35,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You forced me to use this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:49.85,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The result of all my research so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.15,0:22:57.11,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Now, you better let me \Nhave some fun, Iceblade!
